    "updated_at": "2026-11-19T21:17:46Z",
    "body": "Looks already fixed on upstream/main ad03386ea: off_grid_part_keeps_conviction_in_every_prior_traverse_mode passes without a change. Suggest closing; the maintainer decides.\n\nI added a temporary unit test and ran it against unchanged production code. The test passed: 1 passed, 0 failed.\nThe test uses a grid from -20 to 20 in X and Y. The part lies entirely outside the grid, at Y 38 to 42.\nThe part top is Z 9. The rapid travels at Y 40, Z 8, on the clearance plane.\nArea, Boundary, Engrave, Cone, and Envelope all retain RapidInStock. An empty-part control clears the warning in each mode.\n\nThe existing over_part check reads the part facets independently of the grid bounds. Commit e7050be171c317412fb52973496df1983b1efa55 from PR #2138 added this check.\nNo production code changed. No PR was opened. Claim released.\n",
